        "entry_ajBXRQ": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "How do I get a neat top to my hedge?",
            "text": "<p>Use a couple of garden canes and some string to create a cutting line at your desired height, checking it with a spirit level. Then use a ladder or step so that you are at a comfortable height. Go slow, keeping the <a href=\"/collections/hedge-trimmers\" title=\"Hedge Trimmers\">hedge trimmer</a> flat to the top of the hedge. Complete the work in sections, standing back after each run to check that you're still following the line.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
